  ],
  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "comment": "The cells were grown autotrophically in medium containing 6.2 mM NH4Cl, 2.2 mM CaCl2, 1.6 mM MgCl2, 4.4 mM KCl, 1.7 mM KH2PO4, 1.3 mM K2HPO4, 23.8 mM NaHCO3, 20 g/l ground sulfur powder, 1 mg/l resazurin, 1 ml/l SL-10 trace element solution (3 g/l FeCl2 ∙ 4 H2O, 70 mg/l ZnCl2, 100 mg/l MnCl2 ∙ 4 H2O, 4 mg/l FeCl2 ∙ 4 H2O, 24 mg/l NiCl2 ∙ 6 H2O, 36 mg/l Na2MoO4 ∙ 2 H2O, 30 mg/l H3BO3, 224 mg/l CoCl2 ∙ 6 H2O) and 1 ml/l Wolfe’s vitamin solution (20 mg/l biotin, 20 mg/l folic acid, 100 mg/l pyridoxamine dihydrochloride, 50 mg/l thiamine dihydrochloride, 50 mg/l riboflavin, 50 mg/l nicotinic acid, 50 mg/l DL-Ca-pantothenate, 1 mg/l cyanocobalamin, 50 mg/l 4-aminobenzoic acid, 50 mg/l lipoic acid)."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "comment": "The medium was prepared without bicarbonate, sulfur and vitamins, made anaerobic by bubbling with N2/CO2 (80:20) and reduced by the addition of Na2S ∙ 9 H2O to a final concentration of 0.05%."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "comment": "The pH was adjusted to 5.9."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "comment": "The medium was dispensed anaerobically into serum bottles containing sulfur powder; the bottles were sealed with butyryl rubber stoppers and autoclaved for 20 min at 110°C."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "comment": "Prior to inoculation, the medium was supplemented with bicarbonate and vitamins, and the gas phase was replaced with H2/CO2 (80:20) at 1 bar overpressure."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "comment": "Cultures were incubated at 55°C while shaking at 80 rpm."
    }
  ]
}